OL,3,GNEWSAPremature birth mums told 'you are
OL,4,Anot alone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a baby born prematurely
OL,7,Fand who spent months in neonatal care
OL,8,Fhas written a book to inspire and give
OL,9,Fcomfort to those going through similar
OL,10,Fchallenges.
OL,12,FCharlotte was rushed to hospital in
OL,13,FGrimsby, Lincolnshire, in 2024 after
OL,14,Fshe was diagnosed with pre-eclampsia.
OL,15,FHer son Theodore was then born there 12
OL,16,Fweeks early.
OL,18,FHer book, Three Months of Hope, is to
OL,19,Fraise money for the places that looked
OL,20,Fafter him and reflects the start of
OL,21,FTheodore's life.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
